    "content_noencode": "<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">洛洛的第32篇原创文章</span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">大家好，我是洛洛。</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这两年 AI 画图有多强，读者老师应该都有感受。按理说设计师该更轻松了，可实际呢？</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">AI 越强，设计师反而越忙 ，在不同网站和工具之间搬运素材、研究 Prompt、反复调整，时间全耗在切换和搬运上，真正用来想创意的时间又有多少。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">我之前就用过 Lovart，出图质量和审美一直在线。</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">最近发现 Lovart 悄悄完成了一轮重要升级，把功夫都下在了真实设计工作流上，灵感采集支持从 Pinterest、小红书、淘宝、亚马逊一键收集素材直接调用，现在一键收藏直接进画布，十分钟搞定。还有专业 100+专业Skill、Motion、视频、网页、一键转矢量等能力。</span></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">下面是我用升级后的中文版 Lovart做的两款宠物品牌电商详情页。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003378\" data-ratio=\"0.27421875\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCkSZhLENrHJ2OAwRWE9wtSqLXNpaXhkwjF3YmIBAnBv6ufU8ksZHibJqEaBj4BzuBeK5Vq1jrnQpJFFkQO4V0vnm95M9w6k0WZQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">两组电商详情页，从找参考到出图微调，只用了 40 分钟，在过去做一套至少要花两天时间。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003384\" data-ratio=\"0.26953125\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCl4GswibD5qDebUSyxGjPWNEcVhBnzYTH0rIWakiarYtUJjPJEiaCDbU5hVL77eWgHibkib332OkQDEOCv5ZY1vvWYONH22EAqI888k/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">现在宠物经济火到什么程度呢？身边不少把猫当儿子、把狗当闺女的朋友，给毛孩子买零食比给自己买奶茶还积极。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这次一个宠物品牌FurBites找到我们，需求从 Logo 到包装，从海报到电商详情页再到线下活动物料，七组设计一口气跑完，看看全部在 Lovart 站内花多少时间搞定？</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003380\" data-ratio=\"0.15121255349500715\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmrKpib2XJYibNdWucOu5eVE8vUpff9Az2bCkFcFnhJtHfF6f1KAmtia9U9Ge7lfoVQ4yzQ17vDdFN07Q9XYgjiaN6d9BJ4wMTwYVE/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1402\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><b style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">宠物品牌全案设计实战</span></b></span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">case1：Logo 设计</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">品牌名为FurBites ，FurBites这个品牌很在意辨识度， 需要把猫耳朵和狗尾巴藏进字体里，深棕搭配暖橙色，圆润字体变形加猫耳朵和狗尾巴组合，暖橙填充深棕描边， 温暖圆润有品质感。</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">直接选用专业Skill</span></span><span leaf=\"\">，选择极简几何抽象logo。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003382\" data-ratio=\"0.40522875816993464\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmssmqFxAhwibGF3EUEBu9iaHtDfRNKboickLwwCTInrIJ0BQVr5yMyq0PdvK7XVK8BD5hEekRwaRRa7oFuEibL9CB8gVIb5px3TWw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"765\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">输入logo要求，有参考图也可以直接放上。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003381\" data-ratio=\"0.19680851063829788\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCkYze9E1Or4Zvb9q0H3ZGe4sedVicfZ5xDkwFQ8J9cBedhmQT3Tfib7W5r9CrxOBBA61Fbszab7DpHXbjicGTdrNAYPDzIov86e7g/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"940\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">我一眼选中方案4，F 顶上那俩猫耳朵连接的很自然，就像字体本来就该长那样，s 尾巴一甩变成狗尾巴，细节拿捏很到位。从对话框输出到方案输出选择，只花了五分钟。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003383\" data-ratio=\"0.6965116279069767\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KClHVkicyPVWiccqIicicJS6SLNZibia6ibV7SVgiczjiaavBusNstStdseJa9CC9XNJLUN0snzziaaZtlunE8vmvO7nsu4MHOHSGb0eMxxtI/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"860\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">字体很清晰，放大做招牌、缩小当头像都不糊。</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">还可以一键转矢量，十秒出 SVG</span></span><span leaf=\"\">，下载为自己的设计资产。后面做包装海报直接拿来用。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003385\" data-ratio=\"0.3726606997558991\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmiazC8ppibXyiac9D4KEzvIJm1xT4K2v0rnfwZW7q18dicjHdzL0l0Yj3roWq1qVRKBrcVnUOg4QNCrictdOlpsxr7lPQyEL9tWWq0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1229\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">顺手做了个动态版，耳朵晃一晃、尾巴摆一摆，小动物的活泼可爱感一下就出来了，圆乎乎的，看着就想摸。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003398\" data-ratio=\"0.40875\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/smYNP8B0KCmdcnTk2FjeWDl1Ria8LkIfja49se4svKydPicyCVcObBuJuRsPO9ANylRICia1pBshdLdlLxm7OAkGTOdCZvIibulJiaN73187ichlY/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"800\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">case2：宠物零食包装</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这次一定要给大家分享升级后的超级省心的功能--</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">灵感插件，Pinterest、小红书、淘宝这些网站，看到好图可以一键收藏直接进画布参考，Pinterest 和 Google 图片搜索也能直接调</span></span><span leaf=\"\">。直接主页一键安装。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003386\" data-ratio=\"0.36328125\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCluE27U6ZKdNPzYaTppmY5MA0VIkjp2yuBCC1SChfuicTEwNYzZHrs1DjJIyaJJtoraLWCeyDyUkG4lQlqno6K9FA5DBxeD0rfw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这次做包装设计，从小红书收藏多张宠物包装作为参考，再也不用存本地、建文件夹、上传来回倒腾，超省事。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003389\" data-ratio=\"0.6307947019867549\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCkIkDmQibLpk3h11KumfGFs3Hx5V501SPz8VMxosdJI4LljHpKrAM5icNfZODVClZTw3IdEKeLeCrOGAMymJBUW8t14Ft6JEeeZw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1208\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在 Lovart 里选择包装设计专业 Skill。</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">从灵感库调出多张参考图，它会自动拆解参考里的配色和排版。</span></span><span leaf=\"\">这次做六款包装。走温暖手绘风，每款设计一只不同的宠物当主角，放在一起一眼就能认出是一家人。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003399\" data-ratio=\"0.9148471615720524\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/smYNP8B0KCmJzgKZmUA46R3IQ0KcE2HeBYNb5IDhcUbQRzK0pu68ibVxbia3OycqkgGZLyrxrhSfIOCY9D2ApDeI1gCu0Rr5dxPoulibfmy6lw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"gif\" data-w=\"916\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">正面橘猫抱着鱼的插画挺可爱的，配色协调温暖，底部三个卖点图标层级分明。背面是信息密度最高的区域，每个信息板块都做了清晰划分。整体视觉干净，所有信息一目了然。初稿 Logo 占比偏大，通过快捷编辑直接选中 Logo 缩小，几秒就调整到位。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100003387\" data-ratio=\"0.6507128309572301\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmnoD3SA7iagUiaeErictdfY1fdAKGKcibib9fqVHibN2Dc2wURuU6NeFjiaDTibefzJKKclIXdgMrK7oHib1uPsYU7PSF2BeFNbkBoZKug/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"982\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">第一款包装排版就只改了一次。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: mi